 `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves an [RFC 6901 JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901)
 against a JSON document. It returns the referenced value and throws when the pointer is malformed or
 does not identify a value in the document.
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+array using the `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. It returns a new
+JSON document without mutating `document`, and throws when the patch is malformed or an operation
+cannot be applied.
