+---
+id: task-002-implement-rfc-6902-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement `applyPatch(document, patch)` as an RFC 6902 JSON Patch processor.
+
+The implementation will support add, remove, replace, move, copy and test; validate patch and JSON
+Pointer syntax; return a detached result without mutating the input; and include deterministic tests
+for success and failure cases.
